<title>CHINA: Prod-Art changes name to Sino Foundation.</title>
<headline>Prod-Art changes name to Sino Foundation.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prod-Art Technology (Holdings) Ltd said on Thursday it had changed the company name to Sino Foundation Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>The chairman of the electronics firm had in May agreed to sell his 27 percent stake to Kook Kee Incorporated which later held 43.3 percent of the company following close of a cash offer for all outstanding Prod-Art shares.</p>
<p>Prod-Art shares ended HK$0.03 down at HK$0.88 each on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
